---
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-ivory-200" id="how-enquiries-work">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-lavender-700">
        Preorder Process
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-charcoal-900">
        How enquiries work
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-charcoal-700">
        All our covers are currently sold out. We produce stationery in intentional, small-batch runs. Here is how you can ask about the next release:
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-ivory-100 border border-charcoal-800/10 shadow-soft-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-lavender-100 flex items-center justify-center text-lavender-800 font-bold text-lg">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">
            Choose a cover
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
            Browse our personality themes: Floral, Cute, Hinglish, or Cars &amp; Jets. Find the design that resonates with how your mind works.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-charcoal-800/10 text-xs font-medium text-lavender-700">
          Step 1: Explore &amp; save
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-ivory-100 border border-charcoal-800/10 shadow-soft-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-peach-100 flex items-center justify-center text-peach-800 font-bold text-lg">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">
            Ask on WhatsApp
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
            Click "Enquire about preorder on WhatsApp". A pre-filled message with the cover name and reference opens directly in WhatsApp.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-charcoal-800/10 text-xs font-medium text-peach-700">
          Step 2: Start conversation
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl bg-ivory-100 border border-charcoal-800/10 shadow-soft-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-sage-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sage-800 font-bold text-lg">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">
            Review &amp; Decide
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed">
            We confirm final pricing, exact material specifications, and production timelines. An enquiry does not reserve stock or commit you to buy.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-charcoal-800/10 text-xs font-medium text-sage-700">
          Step 3: Zero pressure
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Brand Introduction: Stationery as Personal Expression (No invented founder story) -->
    <div class="mt-16 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-ivory-100 border border-charcoal-800/10 shadow-soft max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 text-center">
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-charcoal-700/60">
        Stationery as Personal Expression
      </span>
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-charcoal-900">
        Objects made for daily thoughts, not display shelves.
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        We believe the notebook you carry should say something true about you. Not every day requires grand manifestos or pristine handwriting. Sometimes you need a page for quick grocery reminders, half-baked jokes, or simply staring at a blank canvas until the words arrive. CUMID pocket diaries are made for whatever is honestly on your mind.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a href="/about" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-lavender-700 hover:text-lavender-900 underline underline-offset-4">
          <span>Read our philosophy</span>
          <span>&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
